{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FIGHT!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mana Smack is a fast-paced, turn-based fighting game where matches can end quickly if your decision making skills are fast enough. Fighters face off against each other 1v1 in a best-of-three format, in which fighters can change their build in between rounds. Build your fighting style with over a hundred different skills and overwhelm your opponent with devasting fighting combos.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Overpower or Outlast</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Matches have two distinct win conditions. Either reduce your opponent's HP to zero and achieve a knock-out victory or accumulate more points than your opponent and achieve a score victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unleash Your Ultimate</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Turn the tide of battle using your ultimate, a powerful skill at the center of your build. Each character will have multiple ultimates, each offering varied experiences and unique playstyles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3680600?t=1746476330","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3680600?t=1746476330","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680600/0221864213b789c3738278f3abc3070897161a9e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746476330","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680600/0221864213b789c3738278f3abc3070897161a9e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746476330","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FIGHT!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mana Smack is a fast-paced, turn-based fighting game where matches can end quickly if your decision making skills 